  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in se\xE7mi\u015F oldu\u011Fun kart \"Y\u0131ld\u0131z\"
    De\u011Ferli {{isim}}.\n\n\xDCz\xFCld\xFC\u011F\xFCn d\xF6nemler mi oldu senin?
    Can\u0131n yanm\u0131\u015F ya da hayat taraf\u0131ndan biraz zorlanm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n
    belli ki... Lakin sonras\u0131nda m\xFCkemmel bir istikamet \xFCzere konumland\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    Sana yepyeni umutlar bah\u015Fedilmi\u015F. Elinden al\u0131nanlar\u0131n yerine
    h\u0131zla yenileri konulmaya ba\u015Flanm\u0131\u015F. D\xF6kt\xFC\u011F\xFCn
    g\xF6zya\u015Flar\u0131, uzay\u0131p g\xF6\u011Fe eri\u015Fecek mutluluk fidanlar\u0131n
    i\xE7in ya\u011Fmur olmu\u015F. \u0130\xE7indeki t\xFCm s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131lardan
    ar\u0131nd\u0131r\u0131lmaya ba\u015Flanm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Yanlar\u0131na
    d\xF6nmemek \xFCzere terk etti\u011Fin s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131lar, bir daha kar\u015F\u0131na
    \xE7\u0131kmayacak \u015Fekilde da\u011F\u0131lm\u0131\u015Flar."
